  "description": "This META V5 ÖHLINS EDITION is a high-end build which enhances the qualities of the frame itself.\n• The RFX 36 Air fork has a spring rate that can be adjusted using the Ramp Up Chamber and the hydraulic cartridge allows for fine-tuning of high- and low-speed compression and rebound damping. The TTX 22M shock is specially adapted to our new Virtual Contact System kinematics for dynamic and comfortable handling.\n• TRP DH-R EVO 4-piston brakes with 203mm discs are progressive and consistent.\n• CRANKBROTHERS Synthesis Enduro aluminium wheels have differentiated stiffness between the front and rear.\n• The SRAM GX Eagle 12-speed drivetrain offers a 520% gear range, ideal for long days on the bike.",
